recommend check-in (Keaton) -- two doors want your word, and both are one question. The QA report card's Truth reading counts whether a cited path RESOLVES, so a page can carry a perfect Truth over proofs nothing runs; that is %467's shape in the instrument that grades everything else, and widening it touches every lane. And the identity gap in the weave still waits, since closing it needs a wider Line while mantra_glow_tend_limb1 locks Line to three fields against a Glow shape.
